[meta]
lang: en
title: OireMark conformance tests: Introduction
[/meta]

h1. Introduction

Tests for the Introduction of the specification: character encoding, line endings, case sensitivity and blank lines.

h2. Byte Order Mark

h3. A leading BOM is stripped {#intro-bom-stripped}
[code hex]
EF BB BF 48 65 6C 6C 6F
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Hello</p>
[/code]

h3. A BOM does not stop a heading from starting the first line {#intro-bom-heading}
[code hex]
EF BB BF 68 31 2E 20 54 69 74 6C 65
[/code]
[code html]
<h1 id="title">Title</h1>
[/code]

h3. A document that is only a BOM is empty {#intro-bom-only}
[code hex]
EF BB BF
[/code]
[code html]
[/code]

h3. U+FEFF in the middle of a line is an ordinary character {#intro-feff-mid-line}
[code hex]
61 EF BB BF 62
[/code]
[code html]
<p>a&#xFEFF;b</p>
[/code]

h3. U+FEFF at the start of a later line is an ordinary character {#intro-feff-later-line}
[code hex]
61 0A EF BB BF 62
[/code]
[code html]
<p>a<br>&#xFEFF;b</p>
[/code]

h2. Invalid UTF-8

h3. Invalid byte on the first line {#intro-invalid-utf8-line-1}
[code hex]
C3 28
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-utf8 1
[/code]

h3. Invalid byte on a later line {#intro-invalid-utf8-line-2}
[code hex]
48 69 0A FF 0A
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-utf8 2
[/code]

h3. Overlong encoding is invalid {#intro-invalid-utf8-overlong}
[code hex]
C0 AF
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-utf8 1
[/code]

h3. Encoded surrogate is invalid {#intro-invalid-utf8-surrogate}
[code hex]
ED A0 80
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-utf8 1
[/code]

h2. Line Endings

h3. LF is a newline {#intro-lf}
[code hex]
61 0A 62
[/code]
[code html]
<p>a<br>b</p>
[/code]

h3. CRLF is one newline, not two {#intro-crlf}
[code hex]
61 0D 0A 62
[/code]
[code html]
<p>a<br>b</p>
[/code]

h3. CR alone is a newline {#intro-cr}
[code hex]
61 0D 62
[/code]
[code html]
<p>a<br>b</p>
[/code]

h3. CRLF blank line separates paragraphs {#intro-crlf-paragraphs}
[code hex]
61 0D 0A 0D 0A 62
[/code]
[code html]
<p>a</p>
<p>b</p>
[/code]

h3. CR blank line separates paragraphs {#intro-cr-paragraphs}
[code hex]
61 0D 0D 62
[/code]
[code html]
<p>a</p>
<p>b</p>
[/code]

h2. Blank Lines

h3. A line of spaces is a blank line {#intro-blank-spaces}
[code hex]
61 0A 20 20 0A 62
[/code]
[code html]
<p>a</p>
<p>b</p>
[/code]

h3. A line holding only a tab is a blank line {#intro-blank-tab}
[code hex]
61 0A 09 0A 62
[/code]
[code html]
<p>a</p>
<p>b</p>
[/code]

h2. Case Sensitivity

h3. Capitalized tag is literal text {#intro-case-capitalized}
[code om]
[Note]
Text
[/Note]
[/code]
[code html]
<p>[Note]<br>Text<br>[/Note]</p>
[/code]

h3. Uppercase tag is literal text {#intro-case-uppercase}
[code om]
[NOTE]
Text
[/NOTE]
[/code]
[code html]
<p>[NOTE]<br>Text<br>[/NOTE]</p>
[/code]

h3. Uppercase closing tag does not close a block {#intro-case-closing}
[code om]
[note]
Text
[/NOTE]
[/code]
[code error]
unclosed-block 1
[/code]

h2. Typography

h3. Double hyphen stays as written {#intro-typography-dashes}
[code om]
Wait -- what?
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Wait -- what?</p>
[/code]

h3. Three dots stay as written {#intro-typography-ellipsis}
[code om]
And so on...
[/code]
[code html]
<p>And so on...</p>
[/code]

h3. Straight quotes stay straight {#intro-typography-quotes}
[code om]
"Quoted" and 'single' and it's
[/code]
[code html]
<p>"Quoted" and 'single' and it's</p>
[/code]

h3. Typed typographic characters pass through {#intro-typography-typed}
[code om]
«Лапки» — і три крапки…
[/code]
[code html]
<p>«Лапки» — і три крапки…</p>
[/code]
